        "text": "=Reduce Map 1 into a clean branch packet.\n\nMap 1 Draft:\n{{ $('Drafter 1') }}\n\nCritic A:\n{{ $('Critic A 1') }}\n\nCritic B:\n{{ $('Critic B 1') }}\n\nReturn exactly:\n- Confirmed facts (5 bullets)\n- Probable implications (3 bullets)\n- Uncertainties (2 bullets)\n- Branch takeaway (2 sentences)",
